  <name>Spectacol</name>
  <summary>Play and debug ZX Spectrum software</summary>
  <developer id="eu.licentia">
    <name>BogDan Vatra</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Spectacol emulates the ZX Spectrum family, including the ZX Spectrum Next,
    Timex and Romanian computers. Its interface supports keyboards, touch screens
    and game controllers.</p>
    <p>Load tapes, disks, snapshots and recordings, browse online software
    catalogues, and explore programs with the built-in debugger and assembler.</p>
  </description>

